00:23:55.477 --> 00:23:55.685
"Next Time"

00:23:55.685 --> 00:23:57.062
"Next Time"
He wants to see her, but can't.

00:23:57.062 --> 00:23:57.270
"Next Time"

00:23:57.270 --> 00:23:59.147
"Next Time"
He hurt her. His heart hurts.

00:23:59.147 --> 00:23:59.356
"Next Time"

00:23:59.356 --> 00:24:02.108
"Next Time"
He can't even say he's sorry.

